#: greenTile.js:2997
msgid ""
"Click or drag: the row sets how many windows the column holds. Right-click "
"removes a column."
msgstr ""
"Klicka eller dra: raden anger hur många fönster kolumnen rymmer. Högerklick "
"tar bort en kolumn."

#: greenTile.js:3002
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Namn"

#: greenTile.js:3003
